    "text": "By Elliott Greene ,\n1 days ago A 59-year-old man has died five days after a bus struck him while he was walking under the Gulf Freeway near Edgebrook Drive, Houston police say, making him the latest pedestrian to die at a stretch of South I-45 that state transportation planners have flagged for years as a crash hot spot. Read full article",
